  "description": "Solve math-based puzzles as you jump from platform to platform in a colorful world made of numbers and geometrical shapes. Join Nero and Sci on their adventure, solo or with a friend, and travel across 4 unique worlds, designed to stimulate logical and mathematical thinking.\n\nJump, think, solve, and explore the world of Héméide\n- 36 levels across 4 distinct worlds\n- Choose between solo or local multiplayer: play as either Néro or Sci\n- Over 20 hours of gameplay with high replayability\n\nA fun workout for the brain\n- Gameplay mechanics recommended by the Institute for Research on Mathematics Education (IREM Lyon)\n- Progressive difficulty and hint system designed for players aged 13+\n- A walkthrough guide of the game's puzzle is available on our Discord server, so you don't feel stuck!",
